      "literal": "$$\n|\\psi\\rangle =\\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}|0\\rangle+e^{i\\varphi}\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}|1\\rangle=\n\\left(\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}\\\\\ne^{i\\varphi}\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right)\n$$",
